          </details>
        </div><%# /mode-function %>

        <div id="mode-complex" hidden>
          <details class="ml-block" open>
          <summary><h2><i class="bi bi-asterisk"></i> Opérations dans ℂ</h2><i class="bi bi-chevron-down ml-caret"></i></summary>
          <div class="ml-block-body">
          <div class="ml-input-row">
            <label for="z1" id="z1-label">z =</label>
            <input id="z1" type="text" value="3+4i" placeholder="ex : 3+4i" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>
          <div class="ml-input-row" id="z2-row" hidden>
            <label for="z2">z₂ =</label>
            <input id="z2" type="text" value="1-2i" placeholder="ex : 1-2i" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>
          <div class="ml-input-row" id="n-row" hidden>
            <label for="cn">n =</label>
            <input id="cn" type="number" value="3" min="2" max="12" step="1" style="flex:0 0 auto; min-width:0; max-width:120px" />
          </div>

          <div class="ml-preview is-empty" id="zPreview">Aperçu du nombre complexe…</div>

          <div class="ml-keys" id="ckeys">
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="i">i</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="+">+</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="-">−</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="*">×</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="/">÷</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="(|)">(&nbsp;)</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="^">^</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="sqrt(|)">√</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key is-util" data-cact="back">⌫</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key is-util" data-cact="clear">C</button>
          </div>

          <div class="ml-ops" id="cops">
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="modulus"><i class="bi bi-rulers"></i> Module |z|</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="argument"><i class="bi bi-compass"></i> Argument</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="conjugate"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left-right"></i> Conjugué</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="algebraic_form"><i class="bi bi-plus-slash-minus"></i> Forme algébrique</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="trig_form"><i class="bi bi-circle"></i> Forme trigo.</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="exp_form"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i> Forme exp.</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="power" data-needs="n"><i class="bi bi-superscript"></i> Puissance zⁿ</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="nth_roots" data-needs="n"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3"></i> Racines n-ièmes</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="arithmetic" data-arith="sum" data-needs="z2"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg"></i> z₁+z₂</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="arithmetic" data-arith="product" data-needs="z2"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i> z₁×z₂</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-cop="arithmetic" data-arith="quotient" data-needs="z2"><i class="bi bi-slash-lg"></i> z₁÷z₂</button>
          </div>

          <div class="ml-hint">Saisissez <strong>z</strong> pour le module, l'argument, le conjugué, les formes… Pour <strong>z₁∘z₂</strong> (somme, produit, quotient), un deuxième champ <strong>z₂</strong> apparaît. Notez l'unité imaginaire <strong>i</strong> (ex : <code>3+4i</code>) ; « n » sert aux puissances et racines.</div>
          </div><%# /ml-block-body %>
          </details><%# /ml-block — Opérations dans ℂ %>

          <details class="ml-block ml-block--eq">
            <summary><h3 class="ml-subtitle"><i class="bi bi-asterisk"></i> Équation polynomiale dans ℂ</h3><i class="bi bi-chevron-down ml-caret"></i></summary>
            <div class="ml-block-body">
            <div class="ml-hint" style="margin-top:.1rem">Résolvez <strong>a·z³ + b·z² + c·z + d = 0</strong>. Les coefficients peuvent être complexes ; mettez <strong>a = 0</strong> pour une équation du second degré.</div>
            <div class="ml-coefs">
              <div class="ml-coef"><label for="eqa">a</label><input id="eqa" type="text" value="1" placeholder="ex : 1" autocomplete="off" /></div>
              <div class="ml-coef"><label for="eqb">b</label><input id="eqb" type="text" value="0" placeholder="ex : 0" autocomplete="off" /></div>
              <div class="ml-coef"><label for="eqc">c</label><input id="eqc" type="text" value="0" placeholder="ex : 0" autocomplete="off" /></div>
              <div class="ml-coef"><label for="eqd">d</label><input id="eqd" type="text" value="-8" placeholder="ex : -8" autocomplete="off" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-preview is-empty" id="eqPreview">Aperçu de l'équation…</div>

            <div class="ml-input-row" style="margin-top:.2rem">
              <label for="eqz0">z₀ =</label>
              <input id="eqz0" type="text" value="i" placeholder="ex : i, -2, 2i" autocomplete="off" style="flex:0 0 auto; min-width:0; max-width:160px;" />
            </div>
            <div class="ml-hint" style="margin:-.2rem 0 .7rem">Démarche guidée : trouvez (ou vérifiez) une racine <strong>z₀</strong>, factorisez f(z) par (z − z₀), puis résolvez le quotient Q(z).</div>

            <div class="ml-ops" id="eqsteps">
              <button class="ml-op" data-eqop="eval_at"><i class="bi bi-calculator"></i> Calculer f(z₀)</button>
              <button class="ml-op" data-eqop="find_root"><i class="bi bi-search"></i> Racine réelle / imaginaire pure</button>
              <button class="ml-op" data-eqop="quotient"><i class="bi bi-diagram-2"></i> Q(z) : f(z)=(z−z₀)Q(z)</button>
              <button class="ml-op" data-eqop="solve_quotient"><i class="bi bi-check2-square"></i> Résoudre Q(z)=0</button>
            </div>

            <div class="ml-ops" style="margin-top:.55rem" id="eq-direct-row">
              <button class="ml-op" id="eq-solve" type="button"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i> Résoudre directement dans ℂ</button>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-hint" id="eq-cubic-hint" style="margin-top:.55rem" hidden>Équation du 3<sup>e</sup> degré : utilisez la démarche guidée ci-dessus (racine évidente → Q(z) → résoudre Q(z)=0).</div>
            </div><%# /ml-block-body %>
          </details><%# /ml-block — Équation %>
          <details class="ml-form">
            <summary><i class="bi bi-journal-text"></i> Formulaire — module, argument, Moivre, Euler</summary>
            <div class="ml-form-grid" id="form-grid-complex"></div>
          </details>
        </div><%# /mode-complex %>

        <div id="mode-geometry" hidden>
          <h2><i class="bi bi-triangle"></i> Points &amp; figures du plan complexe</h2>
          <div id="geo-points">
            <div class="geo-row" data-name="A">
              <label class="geo-label">z<sub>A</sub> =</label>
              <input type="text" value="1+i" placeholder="ex : 1+2i" autocomplete="off" />
              <button type="button" class="geo-del" title="Retirer" style="visibility:hidden">×</button>
            </div>
            <div class="geo-row" data-name="B">
              <label class="geo-label">z<sub>B</sub> =</label>
              <input type="text" value="4+2i" placeholder="ex : 1+2i" autocomplete="off" />
              <button type="button" class="geo-del" title="Retirer" style="visibility:hidden">×</button>
            </div>
            <div class="geo-row" data-name="C">
              <label class="geo-label">z<sub>C</sub> =</label>
              <input type="text" value="2+5i" placeholder="ex : 1+2i" autocomplete="off" />
              <button type="button" class="geo-del" title="Retirer" style="visibility:hidden">×</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="geo-add" id="geo-add"><i class="bi bi-plus-circle"></i> Ajouter un point</button>

          <div class="ml-preview is-empty" id="gPreview">Aperçu des affixes…</div>

          <div class="ml-keys" id="gkeys">
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="i">i</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="+">+</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="-">−</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="*">×</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="/">÷</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="(|)">(&nbsp;)</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-cins="sqrt(|)">√</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key is-util" data-cact="back">⌫</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key is-util" data-cact="clear">C</button>
          </div>

          <div class="ml-ops" id="gops">
            <button class="ml-op" data-gop="plot"><i class="bi bi-bounding-box-circles"></i> Tracer la figure</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-gop="triangle_nature"><i class="bi bi-triangle"></i> Nature du triangle</button>
            <button class="ml-op" data-gop="quad_nature"><i class="bi bi-square"></i> Nature du quadrilatère</button>
          </div>

          <div class="ml-hint">Saisissez les affixes des points (A, B, C, …) puis tracez la figure. La nature se détermine pour <strong>3 points</strong> (triangle) ou <strong>4 points</strong> pris dans l'ordre (quadrilatère).</div>
          <details class="ml-form">
            <summary><i class="bi bi-journal-text"></i> Formulaire — affixes &amp; distances</summary>
            <div class="ml-form-grid" id="form-grid-geometry"></div>
          </details>
        </div><%# /mode-geometry %>

        <div id="mode-integral" hidden>
          <h2><i class="bi bi-integral"></i> Calcul d'intégrale</h2>
          <div class="ml-input-row">
            <label for="ifx">f(x) =</label>
            <input id="ifx" type="text" value="x^2" placeholder="ex : x^2, 1/x, cos(x)" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>

          <div class="ml-side" id="iside">
            <button type="button" class="ml-sidebtn is-active" data-itype="indef">∫ Primitive (indéfinie)</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-sidebtn" data-itype="def">∫ₐᵇ Intégrale définie</button>
          </div>

          <div class="ml-input-row" id="ibounds" hidden>
            <label for="ia">a =</label>
            <input id="ia" type="text" value="0" placeholder="borne inf." autocomplete="off" style="flex:0 0 auto; min-width:0; max-width:120px;" />
